#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:3 21acbf65198d4c0facd3a6dd7b017c12
msgid "Packet Signing"
msgstr "数据包签名"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:9 e09546bd9ca94fa1b7fe1c34aef00bb4
msgid ""
"The signing module sets up and controls the signing of packet with a key. In"
" Mavlink 2.0, this is a feature that allows a vehicle to only accept "
"commands from packets signed with the correct key. This is useful as it "
"lowers the risk of a 3rd party gaining control over the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"signing 模块用于设置和控制使用密钥对数据包进行签名。在 MAVLink 2.0 "
"中，该功能允许飞行器仅接受使用正确密钥签名的数据包命令，降低第三方获取飞行器控制权的风险。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:14 c107c948038f4a3bb664873dc68e637b
msgid "Setup and Removal"
msgstr "设置与移除"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:20 b49af3a092b7421e8a141a715adcff12
msgid ""
"Set the key to ``KEY`` on both MAVProxy and the vehicle. **This is sent in "
"plaintext to the vehicle, so ensure this setup is done over a secure link.**"
msgstr "在 MAVProxy 和飞行器上同时设置密钥为 ``KEY``。**此操作以明文发送至飞行器，请确保在安全链路上进行设置。**"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:23 7d332bdc8e7f437c9a24f1b175285b67
msgid ""
"All packets sent to the vehicle after this command will be accompanied with "
"a SHA-512 hash of the key to confirm the packet's authenticity."
msgstr "此命令之后发送给飞行器的所有数据包都将附带密钥的 SHA-512 哈希值，以确认数据包的真实性。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:30 56271d82e7fb4633824ee73852601090
msgid "Remove the signing key ``KEY`` from MAVProxy and the vehicle."
msgstr "从 MAVProxy 和飞行器上移除签名密钥 ``KEY``。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:36 7410f81fb10440f1af7cba25b323f3f2
msgid ""
"Disable signing of packets with key ``KEY`` from MAVProxy. Does not affect "
"the vehicle - it will still be expecting signed packets."
msgstr "禁用 MAVProxy 使用密钥 ``KEY`` 对数据包签名。不影响飞行器——飞行器仍会期待已签名的数据包。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/signing.rst:43 e1aaab5a51b84ff28e1e703b36112f1f
msgid ""
"Enable signing of packets with key ``KEY`` from MAVProxy. Does not affect "
"the vehicle."
msgstr "启用 MAVProxy 使用密钥 ``KEY`` 对数据包签名。不影响飞行器。"
